==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**15,800 grants 5 Catamin [C].
**15,900 grants 50 Cat Food.
**16,000 grants 1 Rare Ticket.
*Added 1 new feature, [[Cat Capsule#Cat Capsules+|Cat Capsules+]], obtained after clearing [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3.
**Cat Storage increases from 64 to 128, similar to the [[Catfruit]] Storage.
**[[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] will sell for 2NP rather than 1.
**Adds [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|Superfeline]].
*Added New Year [[Cat Scratcher]].
*Leaving the battle takes the player back to the stage map rather than the [[Cat Base Menu]].

